# Pirate Hat: "Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has 'Whenever this creature attacks, draw a card, then discard a card.' Equip Pirate {1}. Equip {2}."
# Bot1 casts a Kitesail Corsair (a Human Pirate, 2/1), an Ornithopter and the Hat on turn 1. On turn 3 Equip Pirate {1} refuses the Ornithopter (not a Pirate) and takes
# the Corsair for the single mana of Mox Sapphire (CR 702.6a): a 3/2. Both attack: only the equipped Corsair has the ability, so Bot1 draws one card (a Forest) and
# discards it, and the Ornithopter's attack draws nothing. The Corsair deals 3 and the Ornithopter 0.

